@hnyls2002 @DarkSharpness @JustinTong0323 could one of you take a look and comment `/tag-and-rerun-ci`? The red checks right now are the `run-ci` label gate.

This one is a single-request server crash: a `response_format` JSON schema whose `$ref` only points back to itself makes the sampler hit a device-side assert and the scheduler exit. Locally on the rebased branch, `test/registered/unit/constrained/` gives 156 passed, and the new `test_xgrammar_backend.py` fails 6 of 7 on main.

Thanks!

